# Cursor Rules for Tajma Project

## Package Manager
- Use `pnpm` instead of `npm` for all package management commands
- When checking for TypeScript errors, use: `pnpm tsc --noEmit`
- When building the project, use: `pnpm build`

## Project Structure
- Frontend: Next.js application in `/frontend` directory
- Backend: Django application in `/backend` directory

## Code Style
- Follow existing code patterns and conventions
- Use TypeScript for type safety
- Prefer functional components with hooks

